<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Got-</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="158" facs="#f0164"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Gotlieb.</hi> Ach, armer, armer <hi rendition="#fr">Robin&#x017F;on,</hi><lb/>
